# API (Vercel Serverless)

- All routes and helpers needed at runtime live **inline** in `api/index.ts`
- Shared types: `import type { ... } from "../shared/api"` only
- Do **not** `import` runtime modules from `../shared/` or `../server/` (breaks Vercel)
- **ALWAYS update `api/swagger.yaml`** in the same change when endpoints, payloads, responses, or behavior change — no exceptions
- If email templates / public flows change, also update **`docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`**
- Dev: single port **8080** for frontend + backend
- Only add endpoints when needed (secrets, DB, server-only logic)
- Keep TypeScript types consistent across `client/`, `api/index.ts`, and `shared/`
- Return `{ error: string }` or `{ success: false, message: string }` with correct status (400/402/403/404/409) — friendly messages, not driver errors
- Email: `sendEmail()` via Resend — never Nodemailer
- DB pool must use SSL when `DB_SSL=true` (TiDB Cloud)
- Vitest: never send live Resend mail; clean TiDB fixtures via `api/testDbCleanup.ts`
- **Stripe**: charge catalog `services.price`; fulfill on `POST /api/stripe/webhook`; `confirm-payment` is idempotent; admin/patient refunds must call Stripe. Do not set `allow_redirects: "never"`. Do not mark a Stripe payment refunded in the DB without a PaymentIntent/charge refund
